Additional information:

This bundle of paths is for navigating Khazarad. MegaMud can do this
already, but it makes the process more efficent. It also includes two
loops for those cheating MudOps who script Khaz (I don't condone this
sort of thing, but it's not my place to tell people what they can and
can't do).
